RIGHTRIGHTD	**	RIGHTDOWN	+*	RS

LEFTDOWN	*_	TURNDOLE1	**	UU
TURNDOLE1	**	TURNDOLE2	**	SU
TURNDOLE2	**	DOWNLEFT	**	SL

DOWNLEFT	*@	DOWNLEFT	+*	LL
