UPUPL		**	UPLEFT		+*	US

UPLEFT		*@	UPLEFT		+*	LL
UPLEFT		*+	UPLEFT		+*	LL
UPLEFT		*.	DOWNDOWNL	+*	DS
DOWNDOWNL	**	DOWNLEFT	+*	DS

UPLEFT		*_	TURNLEUP1	**	RR
TURNLEUP1	**	TURNLEUP2	**	SR
TURNLEUP2	**	LEFTUP		**	SU

LEFTUP		*@	LEFTUP		+*	UU
LEFTUP		*+	LEFTUP		+*	UU
LEFTUP		*.	RIGHTRIGHTU	+*	RS
RIGHTRIGHTU	**	RIGHTUP		+*	RS

RIGHTUP		*@	RIGHTUP		+*	UU
RIGHTUP		*+	RIGHTUP		+*	UU
